'''Dragontail''' is a location on the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

{{ZoneText|Meet the Piglins, members of the Barbarian Faction.|Talk to &4&lChief Scorn&f.|Earn &aReputation &fthrough the daily &aTown Board &fmissions.}}

== Purpose ==
{{Zone|Dragontail}} has many locations inside of it:
* {{zone|Dragontail Auction House}} (Works like the [[Hub Island]] [[Auction House]])
* {{zone|Dragontail Bank}} (Works like the [[Hub Island]] [[Bank]])
* {{zone|Dragontail Bazaar}} (Works like the [[Hub Island]] [[Bazaar]])
* {{zone|Dragontail Blacksmith}} (Works like the [[Dungeon Hub|Dungeon]] [[Blacksmith]])
* {{zone|Chief's Hut}} (Shows daily tasks and is where [[Chief Scorn]] is)
* {{zone|Dragontail Minion Shop}} (Shop with nether-related Tier 12 [[Minions]])
* {{zone|Dragontail Townsquare}} (Heart of Dragontail)
* {{zone|The Bastion}} (Skull structure north of {{zone|Dragontail}}, guarded by [[Barbarian Guard|Barbarian Guards]])
*The Brewery (Building in the north of {{zone|Dragontail}},  with [[Grog]] and a secret number-pad)

